Coverage-only workaround for Foundry's unresolved named-return modifier argument.
Inline returnsIfNotActivatedPre without changing its engine lookup or disabled
engine behavior. This changes bytecode and must never enter a deployment build.

Run through scripts/coverage.sh, which applies this patch temporarily and restores
the source on exit. See test/README.md for the supported coverage boundary.

